WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.170
Oh, hi, Pete. How’s it going?

2
00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:09.410
Hi, Anna. It’s going great. How’s it going with you?

3
00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:16.330
Things are awesome! Pete, I want to work out. Where is the gym?

4
00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:23.710
The gym is across from the lounge. It’s next to the mailroom. Go that way.

5
00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:24.730
Thanks, Pete!

6
00:00:25.860 --> 00:00:30.390
No, Anna! Not that way! Go that way!

7
00:00:57.720 --> 00:01:02.490
Oh, Pete. This is not the gym.

8
00:01:03.340 --> 00:01:05.690
That’s right, Anna. This is the mailroom.

9
00:01:07.680 --> 00:01:11.090
The gym is across from … what?

10
00:01:11.420 --> 00:01:14.090
The gym is across from the lounge.

11
00:01:13.940 --> 00:01:21.430
Across from the lounge. Right. Thanks!

12
00:01:33.820 --> 00:01:40.330
Pete! This is not the gym!

13
00:01:40.180 --> 00:01:49.990
The gym is across from the lounge. It is behind the lobby.

14
00:01:51.520 --> 00:01:54.970
Right. Right. See you.

15
00:01:55.820 --> 00:01:56.970
See you, Anna!

16
00:01:59.460 --> 00:02:00.790
See you.

17
